# Astro desktop (devices/astro.env DESKTOP_LISTS), installed WITH its
# Recommends: Plasma 6 Wayland on panfrost + mediatek-drm (astro-linux618
# docs/desktop.md P1, 2026-11-25). SDDM with a KWin (Wayland) greeter;
# swayidle turns the greeter's panel off when idle (astro-greeter-idle).
# Recommends bring powerdevil (idle screen-off in the session, burn-in
# rule), kscreen, xwayland.
plasma-desktop
konsole
sddm
sddm-theme-breeze
swayidle
# Audio (astro-linux618 docs/audio-stock.md): UCM profile for the "Astro
# Slide" card (overlay usr/share/alsa/ucm2), speaker filter for PipeWire's
# filter-chain (overlay usr/share/pipewire/filter-chain.conf.d);
# alsa-utils for amixer/aplay in sound reports.
alsa-ucm-conf
alsa-utils
